owtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 88.5pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 9pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 9pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;3,303,846&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The depreciation expense for the years ended December&amp;#160;31, 2025 and 2024 was $111 thousand and $111 thousand, respectively.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 5pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.27in;font-weight:normal;;-webkit-margin-before: 0em;-webkit-margin-after: 0em;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;(7)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 0;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;Commitments and Contingencies&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 5pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;"&gt;Commitments&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;There are no short-term or long-term commitments as of December 31, 2025 and 2024.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 5pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-style:italic;display:inline;"&gt;Contingencies&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Provisions for claims settlement are accrued when payment is considered probable and an amount is reasonably estimable. If the best estimate of cost can only be identified within a range and no specific amount within that range can be determined more likely than any other amount within the range, the minimum of the range is accrued. Legal and related professional services costs to defend litigation of this nature are expensed as incurred. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;As of December&amp;#160;31, 2025, there are no contingencies that will materially affect the Company&amp;#8217;s financial position, results of operations or cash flows.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 5pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.27in;font-weight:normal;;-webkit-margin-before: 0em;-webkit-margin-after: 0em;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;(8)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 0;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;Contributions and Advances from Associated and Subsidiary Companies&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The Company received capital from its parent, Cube Hydro Carolinas LLC, of zero and zero for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 5pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.27in;font-weight:normal;;-webkit-margin-before: 0em;-webkit-margin-after: 0em;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;(9)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 0;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;Distribution to member&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The Company distributed zero in 2025 and 2024.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 5pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.35in;font-weight:normal;;-webkit-margin-before: 0em;-webkit-margin-after: 0em;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;(10)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 2;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;Subsequent Events&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;In preparation of its financial statements, the Company considered subsequent events through April 17, 2026, which was the date the Company&amp;#8217;s financial statements were available to be issued.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-left: 0.25in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 11pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;On January 9th 2026, Apollo-managed Funds purchased 100% of the membership interest in HP through their indirect wholly owned subsidiary AP Jaguar Holdings, LLC. Apollo is a high-growth, global alternative asset manager. As of January 9th 2026, AP Jaguar Holdings, LLC is the sole member of HP.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;                  
&lt;/div&gt;
